{"text": "congratulation", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>Borrowed from Middle French, from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">congr\u0101tul\u0101ti\u014d, congr\u0101tul\u0101ti\u014dnem</i>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">congr\u0101tulor</i> (\u201cI congratulate\u201d).\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "The act of congratulating.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["UK", "/k\u0259n\u02cc\u0261\u0279\u00e6tj\u028a\u02c8le\u026a\u0283(\u0259)n/"]]}